{"seq":2,"slug":"curriculum-theory-grad","title":"课程理论","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad","introMarkdown":"# 课程理论 简介\n\n课程理论是教育学的核心学术领域之一，它追问学校应当教什么、为什么教以及如何教等根本性问题。在教育改革日益频繁的当代背景下，课程理论为审视改革方向、评价课程方案和指导教学实践提供了不可替代的理论视角。\n\n本课程从课程理论的基础范式出发，经由当代课程议题的多元探讨和课程实施评价的实践分析，最终聚焦于课程改革的政策与创新，共设四个章节。\n\n第一章**课程理论基础**梳理课程研究的主要范式和模型。课程范式的多元竞争揭示了课程领域内对知识、学生和社会三者关系的不同理解，课程开发模式从泰勒模式到过程模式的演进展示了课程设计理念的转变，隐性课程概念则提醒研究者关注学校中不成文但深刻影响学生的非正式学习经验。\n\n第二章**当代课程议题**关注课程领域的前沿讨论。素养导向课程是当前全球课程改革的主导方向，跨文化课程回应多元社会中教育公平的诉求，数字化课程则探索技术变革对课程形态的重塑可能。\n\n第三章**课程实施与评价**从理论转向实践层面。课程实施的忠实取向与调适取向之间的张力、课程评价的多种模式和方法以及教师在课程转化过程中的能动性角色，构成了理解课程从设计到落地的完整链条。\n\n第四章**课程改革专题**审视驱动课程变革的制度力量和创新实践。课程政策的制定与实施机制、标准化运动的全球扩散及其争议、以及来自基层的课程创新经验，展示了课程改革中自上而下与自下而上两种力量的互动。\n\n建议学习者将理论学习与对本国课程改革实践的观察结合起来，培养理论联系实际的分析能力。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"课程理论基础","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"curriculum-paradigms","title":"研究生 课程理论 — 课程范式","url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad/foundations/curriculum-paradigms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"curriculum-development-models","title":"研究生 课程理论 — 课程开发模式","url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad/foundations/curriculum-development-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hidden-curriculum","title":"研究生 课程理论 — 隐性课程","url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad/foundations/hidden-curriculum"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"contemporary-issues","title":"当代课程议题","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad/contemporary-issues","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"competency-based-curriculum","title":"研究生 课程理论 — 素养导向课程","url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad/contemporary-issues/competency-based-curriculum"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-cultural-curriculum","title":"研究生 课程理论 — 跨文化课程","url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad/contemporary-issues/cross-cultural-curriculum"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-curriculum","title":"研究生 课程理论 — 数字化课程","url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad/contemporary-issues/digital-curriculum"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"implementation","title":"课程实施与评价","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"curriculum-implementation","title":"研究生 课程理论 — 课程实施","url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad/implementation/curriculum-implementation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"curriculum-evaluation","title":"研究生 课程理论 — 课程评价","url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad/implementation/curriculum-evaluation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"teacher-curriculum-making","title":"研究生 课程理论 — 教师课程创生","url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad/implementation/teacher-curriculum-making"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"reform","title":"课程改革专题","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad/reform","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"curriculum-policy","title":"研究生 课程理论 — 课程政策","url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad/reform/curriculum-policy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"standards-movement","title":"研究生 课程理论 — 标准化运动","url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad/reform/standards-movement"},{"seq":3,"slug":"curriculum-innovation","title":"研究生 课程理论 — 课程创新","url":"/education/graduate/education/curriculum-theory-grad/reform/curriculum-innovation"}]}]}